---
agent: 'agent'
description: 'On-board (me i.e. the developer) onto this project. Setup the development environment.'
---

## Preconditions and assumptions
- The user/developer has just cloned this repository.
- The user/developer is new to this project.

## Task
Follow the instructions in `docs/devenv.md` to set up the development environment for the
developer.

Then verify the setup by running, from `acc-connector/`:
1. `python scripts/smoke_check.py` — offline smoke check, needs `SECRET_KEY` set.
2. `python -m unittest discover -s tests` — the stdlib unit tests.

Report which step failed if either does, and do not proceed to describing the codebase
until both pass.

## After setup
Give the developer a short orientation using `docs/design/ARCHITECTURE.md` and
`docs/design/sourcemap.md`. Do not read all source files — use the sourcemap to pick the
handful worth showing.
